# The Everflowing Well: "When The Everflowing Well enters, mill two cards, then draw two cards" (CR 701.17a, 121.1) - turn 1 mills an
# Island and a Lightning Bolt and draws two Islands. Breaking mills eight more on turn 3, seven Islands and a Lightning Bolt: with the
# first Island that is eight permanent cards in the graveyard (CR 110.4a; the Bolts and the Breaking // Entering card are not permanent
# cards), so "Descend 8" transforms it at the beginning of turn 5's upkeep (CR 701.27a) into The Myriad Pools, untapped and still
# the same object. Its {T}: Add {U} casts a Faerie Miscreant: a permanent spell cast with mana The Myriad Pools produced (CR 106.3),
# so Mox Ruby becomes a copy of that spell until end of turn (CR 707.2): a Faerie Miscreant, a 1/1 flier, that is already a
# creature when the spell resolves, so the Miscreant's own "another creature named Faerie Miscreant" is true and it draws.
# At the end of turn the Mox Ruby is itself again (CR 514.2).

